This work builds on the inference-verification method of Rinberg, Karvonen,
Hoover, Reuter & Warr, "Verifying LLM Inference to Detect Model Weight
Exfiltration" (arXiv:2511.02620). The anytime-valid aggregate detector is
described in Ortega-Fernández, Kowalczyk & Warr, "Anytime-valid detection of
LLM weight exfiltration" (arXiv:2610.11843).

